        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9007P/400, Ultra Sleek Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe thin line, Ultra Sleek Door Pull is a slim 5/8 inches wide. It is 17-15/16 inches long for a chic look. This Ultra Sleek Door Handle will fit most standard doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima I 9007P/400 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 15-3/4\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
